## reading
- The server refuses (TEAM_RUN_NOT_RESTORABLE) and sends ERROR TEAM_SEND_MESSAGE_REJECTED with its message on the page's team socket; the web receives it,
  rejects the pending send (teamSendAdmission), keeps the draft and adds an 'Error Occurred' entry (failLocalSubmission).
- The message omits base's reason ('...line 2 is not valid JSON'): unrestorableRoot keeps the detail in the log only (CR-461-069).
- restoreResponses is empty because the probe attaches page.on('websocket') after the team socket opened: Playwright reports frames of new sockets only.
